# EdTech School Analytics Project

## Overview
This project analyzes customer behavior, sales performance, payment methods, training programs, and manager effectiveness for an IT education company.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python (Pandas, NumPy, Seaborn)
- Google Colab
- Power BI
- Google Slides

## Project Files
- Contacts_cleaning — data cleaning and preprocessing
- Calls_Spend_cleaning — data cleaning and preprocessing
- Deals_cleaning — data cleaning and preprocessing
- Analysis — exploratory data analysis and business insights
- Project_presentation — final presentation including Power BI visualizations

## Key Topics
- Customer behavior analysis
- Sales funnel analysis
- Manager performance evaluation
- Payment type analysis
- Training program popularity
- Conversion rate analysis
